From 55c3ebc578f262bbbd5414e35e5a6994a6292fed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:05:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fluid and chemical tanks for WASM block entities (API block
 4)

tank-spec/tank in the WIT (a kind, a substance, whole units), energy-side
renamed flow-side, a pure per-tick transfer between neighbouring tanks
(horizon_mods::flow, tested), the game applying it, harness support
(set-tanks, block-tanks) and the tank-demo example.
